            "name": "Aliens&Asteroids",
            "steam_appid": 661030,
            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/661030/extras/ade59faa0588d0566cce2b2a74e0bc21.poster.avif?t=1520529933\" width=600 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/661030/extras/ade59faa0588d0566cce2b2a74e0bc21.webm?t=1520529933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/661030/extras/ade59faa0588d0566cce2b2a74e0bc21.mp4?t=1520529933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Aliens &amp; Asteroids is a small fast paced space shoot 'em up. It is inspired by the classic arcade game Asteroids improved with new features, like a number of different enemies and bosses, powerful abilities, use items and power-ups. <br><br>See how long you can survive in an unending fight against hordes of hostile aliens and enemy bosses. Fight through different stages, collect power-ups to improve your ship, use mighty use items to clear the screen of any enemies, but whatever you do <strong>never</strong> let your shields deplete.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Developer Comment</h2><i><br>Aliens &amp; Asteroids is a hobby project of mine. Everything except the music was created by me. I hope all of you will enjoy my game and have a good time playing it. If you find any bugs or encounter any problems feel free to contact me at any time and I hope I can help you. I plan to support and add to Aliens &amp; Asteroids for quite a while. (Further items, enemies, stages and bosses)</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/661030/extras/d672b5ff5abdfa394d7e22e69e7e9ef3.poster.avif?t=1520529933\" width=600 height=98 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/661030/extras/d672b5ff5abdfa394d7e22e69e7e9ef3.webm?t=1520529933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/661030/extras/d672b5ff5abdfa394d7e22e69e7e9ef3.mp4?t=1520529933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 4 difficult Bosses </li><li> 5 different enemy types with stronger elite versions</li><li>Powerful abilities</li><li>Unlockable Power-ups and Useitems </li><li> 4 Stages </li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/661030/extras/ade59faa0588d0566cce2b2a74e0bc21.poster.avif?t=1520529933\" width=600 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/661030/extras/ade59faa0588d0566cce2b2a74e0bc21.webm?t=1520529933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/661030/extras/ade59faa0588d0566cce2b2a74e0bc21.mp4?t=1520529933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Aliens &amp; Asteroids is a small fast paced space shoot 'em up. It is inspired by the classic arcade game Asteroids improved with new features, like a number of different enemies and bosses, powerful abilities, use items and power-ups. <br><br>See how long you can survive in an unending fight against hordes of hostile aliens and enemy bosses. Fight through different stages, collect power-ups to improve your ship, use mighty use items to clear the screen of any enemies, but whatever you do <strong>never</strong> let your shields deplete.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Developer Comment</h2><i><br>Aliens &amp; Asteroids is a hobby project of mine. Everything except the music was created by me. I hope all of you will enjoy my game and have a good time playing it. If you find any bugs or encounter any problems feel free to contact me at any time and I hope I can help you. I plan to support and add to Aliens &amp; Asteroids for quite a while. (Further items, enemies, stages and bosses)</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/661030/extras/d672b5ff5abdfa394d7e22e69e7e9ef3.poster.avif?t=1520529933\" width=600 height=98 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/661030/extras/d672b5ff5abdfa394d7e22e69e7e9ef3.webm?t=1520529933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/661030/extras/d672b5ff5abdfa394d7e22e69e7e9ef3.mp4?t=1520529933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 4 difficult Bosses </li><li> 5 different enemy types with stronger elite versions</li><li>Powerful abilities</li><li>Unlockable Power-ups and Useitems </li><li> 4 Stages </li></ul>",
            "short_description": "Inspired by the classic arcade games Aliens &amp; Asteroids is an active and fast space shoot 'em up with a lot of different enemies and bosses. Abilities, Items and Upgrades make for a different experience every time.",
