            "pc_requirements": {
                "minimum": "<strong>Mínimos:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Sistema Operativo *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processador:</strong> AMD Athlon (tm) II P320 Dual Core 2,1 MHz<br></li><li><strong>Memória:</strong> 500 MB de RAM<br></li><li><strong>Placa gráfica:</strong> ATI Mobility RADEON HD 5470<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Versão 11<br></li><li><strong>Espaço no disco:</strong> Requer 100 MB de espaço livre<br></li><li><strong>Notas adicionais:</strong> It ran smothly on every system I tested it on. It will probably run on all normal systems sold in the last 7 years or even longer. If this game does not run anymore then you should probably buy a new PC :D (or I messed up something)</li></ul>"
